SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CET: Realities in Transition RiT2 Open Call #4: Rela
 tional Realities with Beta Festival (XR\, three EUR 15\,000 grants)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 23 Nov 2026 at 23:59 CET.\n\nRealities in Transition (Ri
 T2)\, a Creative Europe XR cooperation project\, and Beta Festival in Irel
 and invite artists\, technologists\, storytellers\, engineers\, hackers an
 d designers to develop XR\, interactive\, multi-user work that explores te
 chnology through relationships between human\, artificial and more-than-hu
 man intelligence\, with a focus on decolonial thinking and interdependence
 .\n\nOrganisation: Realities in Transition (RiT2\, Creative Europe)\, with
  Beta Festival\nLocation: Hybrid residency hosted by Beta Festival\, Dubli
 n\, Ireland (in person May to June 2027). Check the RiT residencies page f
 or country eligibility.\nAward: Three grants of EUR 15\,000 each\, one per
  selected artist. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: 6-month hybrid 
 residency\, March to August 2027\, in person at Beta in May to June 2027\;
  Test Lab in June 2027 and showcase at Beta Festival in November 2027.\n\n
 More: https://www.realities-in-transition.eu/rit-2-open-call-4/?utm_source
 =artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.realities-in-transition.eu/rit-2-open-call-4/?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Hybrid residency hosted by Beta Festival\, Dublin\, Ireland (in pe
 rson May to June 2027). Check the RiT residencies page for country eligibi
 lity.
END:VEVENT
